  "proof_summary": [
    "The installed N06 physical two-root product lower is transported by the actual retained derivative identity. A radius dilation R and height factor H charge exactly H/R^3, with one minimum over the two fixed sides. No reference profile is reselected.",
    "The actual original Morse weight at n+1 is controlled by the same retained midpoint cell and its material sample. The true scaled gap reciprocal length is controlled by the existing same-cell midpoint width theorem.",
    "The product lower becomes a linear minimum-distance lower with kappa=c*radialE(n+1)^(-P0)*physicalGap/2. The identity max+min=gap and max*min=distanceProduct treats both ends in one argument.",
    "The exact reciprocal is (2/c)*radialE(n+1)^P0*physicalGapInverse. Multiplying the two actual sample estimates gives one B and exponent Aw+As before every side, component, sample and point. Inverting this positive bound yields the displayed physical lower."
  ],
  "scope": [
    "Retained reference and actual material data are explicit; this does not apply an unrelated Morse realization to arbitrary Through03.",
    "No Through04, optical root lower, whole-gap single-cell containment, final canonical estimate, new interpolation or replacement of fixed Y/H/delta is assumed.",
    "Only actual tail gaps are covered here. The finite central component exceptions are handled separately."
  ],
